    "polysemy": {
      "title": "一詞多義",
      "html": "<p class=\"level-badge\"><strong>程度說明：中二・加深（同字異義對訓）</strong></p><p class=\"know-lead\">中二訓練「同卷兩見，必須分釋」。</p><img class=\"know-chart\" src=\"art/knowledge/chart_polysemy.png\" alt=\"一詞多義示意\"><div class=\"know-table-wrap\"><table class=\"know-table\"><thead><tr><th>字</th><th>義項</th><th>例子</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>亡</td><td>丟失</td><td>亡羊補牢</td></tr><tr><td>亡</td><td>滅亡</td><td>國亡</td></tr><tr><td>亡</td><td>通「無」（視文）</td><td>亡以應</td></tr><tr><td>勝</td><td>禁得住</td><td>不勝怒</td></tr><tr><td>勝</td><td>戰勝</td><td>勝敵</td></tr><tr><td>坐</td><td>坐著</td><td>坐視</td></tr><tr><td>坐</td><td>獲罪（古）</td><td>連坐</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"know-tip\">測驗兩處同字：切勿兩處抄同一解釋。</p>",
